WEBVTT

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:20.140
Rental Magica

00:02:08.990 --> 00:02:11.960
Episode 7
THE RED-HAIRED GIRL

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:16.260
If I can do it, it's normal.
If I can't, I'm an idiot.

00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:24.430
I guess talented people really
aren't suited to being teachers.

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:29.300
Honami just doesn't understand how a
student who's out of his depth feels.

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:34.210
Still, I worked hard today, and
now I get to reward myself!

00:02:42.290 --> 00:02:44.990
Pardon me, are you all right?

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:52.660
Whoa! Hang on a sec!

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:16.060
Here you go.

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:21.450
You're bleeding, aren't you?

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:33.430
You aren't surprised by Lapis?

00:03:33.610 --> 00:03:39.070
Huh? Oh! Well, after what I've seen lately...

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:42.950
Lapis is a homunculus.

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:45.550
Homunculus?

00:03:46.020 --> 00:03:47.080
An imitation human.

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:50.950
A homulus, created from
nothingness by alchemy.

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:53.930
If you don't understand,
you may think of Lapis as a monster.

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:55.530
No way.

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:00.190
Hm?

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:06.560
Oh, you're just hungry.

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:10.640
Let me see that. Now watch.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:14.180
There you go.

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:19.050
Tastes good, huh?

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:30.790
There goes my treat.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:38.500
Oh, well.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:44.900
They're coming.

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:47.270
Huh? Who's coming?

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:52.310
Lapis will come again.

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:54.080
What, here?

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:58.690
Oh, well, in that case... Take this.

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:05.570
It's got my address on it.

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:10.430
Mage Recruiting Agency
ASTRAL
We rent mages to meet your demands.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.480
Itsuki! Lapis came to you!

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:20.310
Whoa! Uh, Lapis...

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:22.580
So, you're name's Lapis.

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:25.320
Mr. President, you sly dog!

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:27.010
It's not like that!

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:28.750
Then what is it like?

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:31.930
I don't know what her story is,
but before you got here,

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:36.020
she was just standing there without
telling us her name or what she wanted.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:39.930
A-Anyway, let's all calm down.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:44.670
You want the eye of a basilisk?

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:48.110
Are you saying you know what that is?

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.380
Basil?

00:05:55.980 --> 00:05:57.140
Basilisk.

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:00.620
The king of venomous serpents,
mentioned in the Book of Jeremiah.

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:04.250
Anyone who looks into its eyes
will be turned to stone and die.

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:07.320
Well, it's a monster from a legend.

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:09.430
Oh, just a legend, huh?

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:12.860
Lapis, no matter what we do, that's impossible.

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:17.230
Payment.

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:19.340
What a pretty gold coin!

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:23.340
You're saying you'll give us this
if we find a basilisk eye for you?

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:28.610
A Roman gold coin.

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:30.540
Could be a fake, though.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:32.720
Oh, a fake, huh?

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:39.250
No, a fake as intricately made as this
would be worth more than the real thing.

00:06:39.590 --> 00:06:42.860
Off the top of my head, I'd guess
it's worth, hmm... 400,000 yen.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:44.120
What?

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:48.630
Even so, no matter how valuable a thing
she gives us, if it's impossible to get...

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:52.270
Here, I have your contract ready.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:54.840
You can just sign it for now.

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:56.100
Nekoyashiki!

00:06:56.210 --> 00:06:57.870
Could you at least tell us the reason why?

00:06:58.010 --> 00:07:00.780
Why do you want a basilisk eye?

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:02.840
Honami, you too?

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:04.520
Lapis doesn't know.

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:06.820
Lapis is just doing it because
my big brother asked me to.

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:07.660
Your big brother?

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:08.320
And now just sign here...
Your big brother?

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:08.460
And now just sign here...

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:09.490
And now just sign here...
Then we don't have any business...

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:09.690
Then we don't have any business...

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:11.020
...looking for it, either.

00:07:11.230 --> 00:07:12.890
Right, it's impossible.

00:07:13.690 --> 00:07:15.290
Lapis will guide you.

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:38.180
I never knew there was a place in
Furube with such strong spell power.

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:41.620
Normally, I would have
sensed it a long time ago.

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:43.880
The spell power isn't leaking out.

00:07:43.960 --> 00:07:46.150
Someone must have cast a barrier around it.

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:47.220
Barrier?

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:51.590
Isn't looking for a legendary monster
just going to be a waste of time?

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:53.730
I think it could be spell wave contamination...

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:56.360
...manifesting itself in the form of a basilisk.

00:07:57.740 --> 00:08:01.970
If we run into a basilisk, under no
circumstances look into its eyes.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:03.640
Especially you, Boss!

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:06.740
Lapis!

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:18.560
Where did she go?

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:25.560
Let's just bring Lapis back
and get out of here, fast!

00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:31.200
How are we even supposed to get the
basilisk's eye if we can't look at it?

00:08:32.010 --> 00:08:35.970
I know how tempting that money is,
Nekoyashiki, but this is just crazy!

00:08:36.610 --> 00:08:39.510
If I hadn't accepted her request,
you would have, wouldn't you?

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:41.910
Or were you going to refuse that girl?

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:44.140
Well...

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:47.120
Besides, even if you had refused her request,

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:49.750
I have a feeling we'd have
ended up doing it anyway.

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:53.990
What's that supposed to mean?

00:08:59.370 --> 00:08:59.960
Lapis?

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:05.700
Lapis!

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:16.840
Is this the basilisk?!

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:41.980
The president's in there!

00:09:42.780 --> 00:09:44.970
Seiryu! Suzaku! Byakko! Genbu!

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:51.140
I can get in from here!

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:55.280
Cast a barrier around Lapis!

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:06.320
Brother Pres, get down!

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:07.500
Mikan!

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:08.860
Tohokami, Emitame!

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:11.100
Remove what is unclean, and purify!

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:18.010
Mikan!

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:27.080
Mr. President!

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:28.380
Don't take it off!

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:33.420
Nekoyashiki! Right oblique, 36 degrees,
2 meters forward! Fire line charm!

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:38.360
Honami! Right, 24 degrees downward,
fire mistletoe arrows!

00:10:38.730 --> 00:10:39.500
Hail!

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:11.370
Icchan!

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:12.500
Brother Pres!

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:13.300
Mr. President!

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:19.140
He has no external injuries,

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:22.410
but the right side of his body has
suffered severe spell wave contamination.

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:24.510
It's because he took off his eyepatch.

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:28.280
In the throne of heaven where
dwells the emperor of the gods,

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:30.350
by the power of the divine
fire and water principles,

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:33.120
I summon to us the spirits of all creation.

00:11:52.740 --> 00:11:53.800
Nekoyashiki!

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:55.440
Stay away from him!

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:59.840
The president's spell wave contamination
has infected Nekoyashiki as well.

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:03.710
I'll be all right.

00:12:04.350 --> 00:12:07.090
Anyway, there's no point
in purifying him like this...

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:09.780
...if you two get contaminated as well.

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:13.090
Honami, see to the rest of his treatment.

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:20.070
I'm getting some mistletoe.

00:12:20.370 --> 00:12:21.560
R-Right.

00:12:48.130 --> 00:12:50.650
The president is all right now.

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:54.490
Thank goodness...

00:12:55.570 --> 00:12:56.630
Nekoyashiki!

00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:02.130
I'm really wiped out.

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:05.510
Could you please make me
a cup of warm herbal tea?

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:13.180
That hits the spot.

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:19.780
Um... Did Itsuki take off his eyepatch again?

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:23.600
What he did was reckless.

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:26.530
To have invoked his Glam
Sight in front of a basilisk,

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:29.500
after we told him that touching its blood...

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:32.060
...or even a breath from it could kill him...

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:34.670
And that's why he ended up in that state?

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:40.180
The more powerful the magic,
the greater the debt he has to pay.

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:41.650
Debt?

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:45.250
Take my fatigue as an example.

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:53.760
Then, if he keeps using his eye like
this, what will happen to Itsuki?

00:13:54.760 --> 00:14:00.830
Only Tsukasa Iba, the former president,
knew the details of that eye of his.

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:03.100
Itsuki's father?

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:07.900
Glam Sight is so rare that we
don't know the facts about it,

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:10.110
including the debt he'll pay.

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:16.580
Then we'll just have to try as hard as we can!

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:22.020
Because we can't let Itsuki use his eye.

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:25.830
W-What's wrong, Nekoyashiki?

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:27.620
Did I say something funny?

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:34.030
The president's nature seems to
lead people to think that about him.

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:40.330
No... It's doing him a disservice
to say that it's his nature.

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:44.570
There's a reason everyone loves him.

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:49.910
If he realizes that,
he'll have taken another step forward.

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:00.290
Itsuki?

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:05.050
Itsuki, why won't you wake up?

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:09.430
What are you doing?!

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:15.580
Don't touch Brother Pres!

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:17.900
Lapis will stay by his side!

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:21.710
This is all your fault, Lapis!

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:25.840
If you hadn't suddenly disappeared,
he wouldn't have!

00:15:26.490 --> 00:15:27.980
It's not Lapis's fault!

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:31.520
It is too your fault!

00:15:32.230 --> 00:15:34.720
No! It's because you were too weak!

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:37.100
What did you say?!

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:39.830
Itsuki ended up like this
because he was protecting you!

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:45.270
None of this would have happened if we
hadn't gone looking for the basilisk!

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:49.140
Both of you... stop fighting...

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:51.070
Brother Pres!

00:15:52.980 --> 00:15:53.740
Itsuki!

00:15:55.280 --> 00:15:57.250
I'm okay now...

00:15:57.620 --> 00:16:00.420
Lapis didn't want you to get hurt.

00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:03.210
Yeah. I know.

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:06.390
But Lapis had to do this,
because Big Brother told me to.

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:10.260
Your wound...

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:12.970
Green blood!

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:15.170
You're a homunculus, aren't you?

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:17.440
Homunculus? You mean a familiar?

00:16:17.770 --> 00:16:19.930
Did you know about this, Boss?

00:16:20.110 --> 00:16:20.870
Yeah.

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:23.810
Why did you hide such an important fact from us?

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:26.210
I wasn't hiding anything.

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:28.910
I mean, Lapis is Lapis.

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:31.110
She isn't different from any other person.

00:16:31.890 --> 00:16:33.390
Why didn't you tell us,

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:35.820
especially when you barely know
anything about homunculii?!

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:37.620
That was beyond reckless, Boss!

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:38.760
Honami...

00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:42.900
Even if Lapis herself didn't mean us any harm,

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:46.260
if whoever is controlling her did,
she'd act the same way!

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:50.530
Wait a second! Lapis did nothing wrong!

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:54.400
Show me your eye!

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:58.540
Of course it hurts.

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:02.280
If Nekoyashiki hadn't purified it immediately,

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:04.750
you might be dead by now.

00:17:06.050 --> 00:17:08.780
Sorry for worrying you all.

00:17:14.190 --> 00:17:17.330
Even though I am most impure,
I ask that you cleanse me and grant clarity,

00:17:17.330 --> 00:17:19.820
Both within and without.

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:20.960
Mikan!

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:25.100
A misogi is an absolute barrier
against every form of defilement.

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:28.680
So, it will have no effect at all on a human.

00:17:28.910 --> 00:17:30.840
But against a homunculus!

00:17:30.910 --> 00:17:31.840
No...

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.540
Brother Pres, stay out of this!

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:43.720
If you get any closer, the spell
wave interference will hurt him!

00:17:43.890 --> 00:17:45.650
So you won't get even a step in here!

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.660
Mikan, stop it!

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:49.430
Boss!

00:17:51.330 --> 00:17:53.390
It was your brother who created you?

00:17:55.870 --> 00:18:00.040
To be able to manipulate a homunculus,
a being that should only be able...

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:03.680
...to live in a test tube,
you must have a very talented master.

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:07.770
so why would he specifically
hire Astral for this job?

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:09.810
Just stop! I get it!

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:11.780
I'm sorry, Lapis.

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:14.980
It's just that everyone here is like family to me.

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:18.980
I don't like having them
fight like this. So, please...

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:20.650
Family?

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:24.200
Um, well... Family is...

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:27.330
How do I put it?
The most important people to you.

00:18:27.730 --> 00:18:28.760
Important?

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:33.230
Right. Honami and Mikan
aren't just bullying you.

00:18:33.640 --> 00:18:34.610
Important...

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:37.740
But a lot happened today...

00:18:37.910 --> 00:18:40.210
Lapis wishes she had never seen you.

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:42.410
Lapis wishes she had never known you.

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:43.680
Lapis?

00:18:44.050 --> 00:18:45.620
What would you do, Itsuki?

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:49.320
If you knew that, till the day
you died, you'd never get it?

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:50.620
What are you talking about?

00:18:51.130 --> 00:18:55.530
If you knew that you'd never,
ever get the thing you wanted most...

00:18:56.400 --> 00:19:00.300
Yes, Big Brother. Lapis wants to do it.

00:19:00.370 --> 00:19:02.490
Lapis, who are you talking to?

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:05.430
Lapis will hurt Itsuki.

00:19:13.580 --> 00:19:14.340
Look out!

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:24.790
Mr. President!

00:19:26.730 --> 00:19:27.490
Honami!

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.520
Mr. President, Mikan, are you all all right?

00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:36.570
Where's Lapis?

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:49.340
Mr. President, are you thinking of doing
something troublesome again?

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:52.980
Like going out to find and rescue Lapis?

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:58.050
It just doesn't feel right to leave her like that!

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:03.430
Still, why did Lapis want that basilisk eye?

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:08.960
I don't know. But it's clear
who she was working for.

00:20:11.170 --> 00:20:15.540
An alchemist who was able to freely
manipulate a homunculus like her...

00:20:16.710 --> 00:20:21.750
Besides that, the one unfinished flaw he
left in this to let us see that it was a fake...

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:26.450
...was done to let us know of his existence.

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:28.320
His? Who is it?

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:31.990
Judaix Tholoide.

00:20:33.860 --> 00:20:35.290
You know who he is too, Honami?

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:40.660
One of Astral's founders and
former company director.

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:46.140
And, more than anyone else, a man who
adored your father, Tsukasa Iba.

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:47.300
Father?

00:20:57.550 --> 00:20:59.210
Big Brother, Lapis is back.

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:02.580
You're one minute and seventeen seconds late.

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:04.550
Where is the basilisk eye?

00:21:07.630 --> 00:21:09.690
So, you got it.

00:21:29.480 --> 00:21:30.510
Big Brother...

00:21:42.100 --> 00:21:45.860
I thought it would be amusing to have
him killed by the basilisk, however...

00:21:50.270 --> 00:21:54.210
Tsukasa Iba's son... How fascinating.

00:21:58.280 --> 00:22:07.880
Over and over, holding my wounded hand...
Kizutsuku te wo nandomo tsunaide

00:22:08.290 --> 00:22:16.290
...you walk this uncertain path with me...
fuan bakari no kono michi wo aruite

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:29.340
...amidst the days as they slowly drift by.
yukkuri nagareta hibi no naka de bokura ga

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:41.250
The things we obtain are so warm, so beloved.
Te ni shita mono wa konna ni atatakute itoshinda

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:47.520
Please, as time goes by, let's keep right on...
Nee konomama toki no naka

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:52.030
...laughing and walking together.
waratte aruite yukou

00:22:52.900 --> 00:22:56.300
It's because you're with me...
Kimi ga iru kara

00:22:56.300 --> 00:23:01.400
...that I can keep moving forward.
mae ni susumerunda

00:23:02.340 --> 00:23:13.280
Now our feelings are becoming one...
Ima bokura no omoi ga hitotsu ni natte

00:23:13.650 --> 00:23:17.320
...and showing the path to us.
michi wo shimesunda

00:23:17.320 --> 00:23:21.560
So please, keep on holding my hand...
Dakara kono te zutto

00:23:21.660 --> 00:23:24.650
...and never let it go...
hanasanaide

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:27.030
Mistletoe [YADORIGl]

00:23:27.030 --> 00:23:28.500
Mistletoe [YADORIGl]
That's the stuff you use, right, Honami?

00:23:28.500 --> 00:23:31.710
Mistletoe [YADORIGl]
